🌀 Kafka Features
| Feature                 | Kafka Supports       |
| ----------------------- | -------------------- |
| Durability              | ✅                    |
| Message Replay          | ✅                    | because it store data on disk so we can play it again
| Partitioned Parallelism | ✅                    |
| High Throughput         | ✅                    |
| Pub/Sub Pattern         | ✅                    |
| Message Ordering        | ✅ (within partition) |
